{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272860/extras/10_01_55_01__DuckLaserDuck_mZyiHiZrp3.png?t=1744399577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey, welcome to DuckLaserDuck. You just have to <strong>kill the bugs</strong> and critters before they kill you, so you can <strong>kill the bugs</strong> <strong>EVEN BETTER.</strong> Defeat 3 bosses to win the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this top-down bullet-hell style roguelike, you'll exterminate the pests while dodging their bullets. And there are\u00a0<strong>HATS, </strong>which just look pretty cool. But it's not all fun in the sun. Dying sucks and health is pretty rare, so don't take damage. There are difficult bosses that want to stop you from becoming stronger. Luckily, you can get stronger\u00a0by harnessing the magical powers of over 75 unique items. You can use these items to create diverse and creative solutions to surpass the every-stronger bugs. Eat that yummy dopamine when you finally get the key piece of your combo and beat the 3rd boss with your\u00a0<strong>UPGRADES</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bird Brain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3272860/4c43897c2298a71aea2de85d81423fe7f49d872e.jpg"},{"name":"Millionaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3272860/de26b4cbfacdae520bf8057d3c703dc101d0efa4.jpg"},{"name":"Nuclear Warhead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3272860/4c8faf3ec5fd8e357c0da7a9f50cdc790bd9f577.jpg"},{"name":"War Machine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3272860/4af36699784e0b77b45340674094039a5d66e8f9.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3272860?t=1744399577","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3272860?t=1744399577","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272860/aa7a5fd5ee821ed91c20ae10600ed39e6e37d04a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744399577","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272860/aa7a5fd5ee821ed91c20ae10600ed39e6e37d04a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744399577","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272860/extras/10_01_55_01__DuckLaserDuck_mZyiHiZrp3.png?t=1744399577\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hey, welcome to DuckLaserDuck. You just have to <strong>kill the bugs</strong> and critters before they kill you, so you can <strong>kill the bugs</strong> <strong>EVEN BETTER.</strong> Defeat 3 bosses to win the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this top-down bullet-hell style roguelike, you'll exterminate the pests while dodging their bullets. And there are\u00a0<strong>HATS, </strong>which just look pretty cool. But it's not all fun in the sun. Dying sucks and health is pretty rare, so don't take damage. There are difficult bosses that want to stop you from becoming stronger. Luckily, you can get stronger\u00a0by harnessing the magical powers of over 75 unique items. You can use these items to create diverse and creative solutions to surpass the every-stronger bugs. Eat that yummy dopamine when you finally get the key piece of your combo and beat the 3rd boss with your\u00a0<strong>UPGRADES</strong>.</p>","developers":["Michael Aaron Denny"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"descript